## Code Practiced

```python
if __name__ == '__main__':
    n = int(input())

    student_marks = {}

    for _ in range(n):
        name, *line = input().split()
        scores = list(map(float, line))
        student_marks[name] = scores

    query_name = input()

    sum1 = sum(student_marks[query_name])
    avg1 = sum1 / len(student_marks[query_name])

    print(f"{avg1:.2f}")
